{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/924402950/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1757086804000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://econpapers.repec.org/paper/hhsiuiwop/1530.htm?ref\" target=\"_blank\">An alternate model for training economists?</a></p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/brazilbrian/status/1961795823605305574?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">RIP Luis Fernando Verissimo</a>.  <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Borges-Eternal-Orangutans-Fernando-Verissimo/dp/081121592X/ref=sr_1_1?crid=315IR0R9U2IAV&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.oxUWf9XWv6Vz6AM9qBCCEMNSCWcNR2iPn6YmNVjpuTM.k1-1x4FMl0WyaIv5UBVu94-ppSj3-i8nZRBVlTMgD6Y&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=Borges+and+the+Eternal+Orang-utans&amp;qid=1756582066&amp;sprefix=borges+and+the+eternal+orang-utans%2Caps%2C242&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Borges and the Eternal Orangutans</a> is a very fun book for me.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/GlennLuk/status/1962258662744826274\" target=\"_blank\">Chinese guy builds Cat World, Department of Why Not?</a></p>\r\n<p>4. “Walking Tall?” (NYT).  <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/08/31/us/buford-pusser-walking-tall-tennessee.html\" target=\"_blank\">The husband did it</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/research_fri/status/1962834260953268448?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">AI progressed more quickly than superforecasters had expected</a>.  Green energy did not.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://joshuatravisbrown.substack.com/p/behind-closed-doors-the-inequalities\" target=\"_blank\">Price dis